{"id": "EUVD-2026-104688", "enisaUuid": "90e6bf7a-7e32-3268-b441-2f74c55c11cd", "description": "DB-GPT through 0.8.2 contains an unauthenticated remote code execution vulnerability because the /api/v1/chat/react-agent endpoint relies on a mock get_user_from_headers function that grants every caller the admin role. Unauthenticated attackers can send prompts that make the ReAct agent's unsandboxed code_interpreter and shell_interpreter tools run arbitrary Python or bash as root in the webserver container, including reaching the bundled database with default credentials.", "datePublished": "2026-10-20T00:46:11", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20T13:49:48", "baseScore": 9.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://www.lasso.security/vulnerability-database/cve-2026-77932", "https://github.com/eosphoros-ai/DB-GPT/blob/83609c471266607490b24e72188311efa23a0d16/packages/dbgpt-serve/src/dbgpt_serve/utils/auth.py#L25", "https://github.com/eosphoros-ai/DB-GPT/blob/83609c471266607490b24e72188311efa23a0d16/packages/dbgpt-app/src/dbgpt_app/openapi/api_v1/tools/code_interpreter.py#L39", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/db-gpt-through-0.8.2-unauthenticated-rce-via-api-v1-chat-react-agent"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-77932", "GHSA-5vjv-vw3m-qpqp"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.64, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "ccf0f351-6741-369a-b83f-03e619025ef1", "product": {"name": "db-gpt", "vendor": {"name": "eosphoros-ai"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22640.8.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "b723e7dc-853c-38d0-87a9-d1d2b0f1f20a", "vendor": {"name": "eosphoros-ai"}}], "isExploited": false}